{
  "_readme": [
    "Example data showing how to fill each Firestore collection the app reads.",
    "Import it with `pnpm sample:import` and remove it again with `pnpm sample:clear`",
    "(every sample doc id starts with `sample-`, so your own data is never touched).",
    "Each collection lists its fields under `_fields`; the document id must equal the `id` field.",
    "Photos are never stored in Firestore: the app's photo picker compresses the image, uploads it to",
    "Cloud Storage under spl_media/<collection>/ and saves the download URL in the photo field.",
    "In these samples photo fields are null — add photos from the app (✎ edit → Choose photo).",
    "Dates are `YYYY-MM-DD` strings; `createdAt` is epoch milliseconds (newest shows first)."
  ],
